Add Gemini CLI as a supported agent target (`--agent gemini`, included in `--agent all`), installing skills into `.gemini/skills` or `~/.gemini/skills`, discoverability blocks into `GEMINI.md` or `~/.gemini/GEMINI.md`, and `type: skill-command` runtime hooks into `.gemini/settings.json` or `~/.gemini/settings.json` with `--gemini-home` override and manifest-tracked uninstall support.
